  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Jus 406.01 Electronic Publication. In accordance with RSA 7:32-a, the director shall prepare and cause to be published on the website for the department of justice a directory of charitable trusts.\n\nSource. #13455, eff 10-7-22; ss by #14162, eff 12-27-24",
